# A space the typed text names leads the command bar, as in Arc: with a space called Finance, "finan" lists
# Switch to Finance first and selects it, so Return goes to the space. Cra selected the search and listed the
# space third, under an archived page titled "… Financial …", whose word match scored higher than the space's.
# Only the start of the space's name counts: a word inside it ("proj", Side Projects), a typed address
# ("localhost", a space called Localhost) and text that names no space keep the search first.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
